 see\") facing name and description.",[235,239,240],{},"A training\u002Fmodule that someone has been \"granted\" or has succcessfully taken the test for.",[235,242,243],{},"A qualification can require certain prerequisites. A prerequisite can be a job rank, other successful qualification.",[245,246,248],"h3",{"id":247},"what-elements-are-needed","What elements are needed?",[232,250,251,262,265,268],{},[235,252,253,254],{},"Qualification: Holds all basic infos about the qualification.\n",[232,255,256,259],{},[235,257,258],{},"Access: Holds the access levels to the qualification.",[235,260,261],{},"Requirements: Requirements to be able to take the qualification. -> Don't deny the access to the qualification like access, but are required to send a request or to take the qualification.",[235,263,264],{},"Requests: List of user requests to take the test for the qualification.",[235,266,267],{},"Results: A \"mapping\" of score of an user test.",[235,269,270,271],{},"Tests: Test progress of (started) tests from users.\n",[232,272,273,276,279],{},[235,274,275],{},"Info\u002FConfig of the Test: E.g., how many questions need to be right to pass, how much time do they have, etc.",[235,277,278],{},"Test Questions: Questions for the qualification tests.",[235,280,281],{},"User Test Answers: Answered questions \"waiting for approval\" by a \"trainer\".",[245,283,285],{"id":284},"access-levels","Access Levels",[219,287,288],{},"Similarily structured to documents access levels.",[232,290,291,294,297,300,303,306],{},[235,292,293],{},"Blocked.",[235,295,296],{},"View.",[235,298,299],{},"Request.",[235,301,302],{},"Take.",[235,304,305],{},"Grade.",[235,307,308],{},"Edit.",[227,310,312],{"id":311},"exams","Exams",[219,314,315],{},"3 modes for a qualification with an exam:",[232,317,318,321,324],{},[235,319,320],{},"Disabled.",[235,322,323],{},"Request needed.",[235,325,326],{},"Enabled.",[245,328,330],{"id":329},"flow-request-needed","Flow - Request needed",[332,333,334],"mermaid",{},[